      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's definitely cleaner. \n\nOne thing though—the automated score for this one came back a bit low. It's flagging the recipe as \"potentially thin\" on instruction. I know I said not to game it, but since the software uses that `count(ingredient_mentions)` metric to decide which recipes get prioritized for the print edition, could you try expanding the steps a bit more? \n\nMaybe go into a bit more detail about the process itself so the instruction feels a bit more \"thorough\"? Just please keep it sounding professional and avoid just listing the ingredients repeatedly for the sake of it.",
